sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Agent
  participant G as Gateway
  participant O as OPA
  participant H as Human
  participant M as Mail server
  A->>G: fetch untrusted page
  G->>O: allow
  O-->>G: allow
  Note over G: session saw_untrusted
  A->>G: mail.send_email to a colleague
  G->>O: outbound after untrusted
  O-->>G: needs_approval
  G-->>A: needs_approval, approval id
  H->>G: approve that exact call
  A->>G: same send again
  G->>M: tools/call with a downstream token
  M-->>G: sent
  G-->>A: allow
